# Time-line colour is a rainbow

Red at first acquisition, then orange, yellow, green, cyan, blue, violet
at last. Sail lines, transits, and the bottom timeline bar all use that
sequence.

Do not collapse this to a yellow wash, a single yellow/overview stroke, or
a flat green preplot. Do not replace per-segment timeline colours with an
empty bar or a CSS gradient that ignores visit time. Show All must not
duplicate every sail line on top of the rainbow preplot.

